  <item>
    <title>【不二小茶会 005】国内探馆体验 + 攀岩训练干货总结</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662ec94b5fb33c1b2b346a61</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662ec94b5fb33c1b2b346a61</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Apr 2024 22:10:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期播客我们将和大家分享这次二月回国在成都、武汉以及上海的探馆体验，最后为大家总结了「Beast Making」这本书里推荐的攀岩训练方法，我们主要侧重介绍了四个部分：手臂、核心、手指和耐力，希望能够对大家有所帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家快来听干货！后续文字图片版本会陆续更新到小红书@噢不二呀，记得来复习噢～</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起进步，冲呀！💪</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 国内探馆体验（成都、武汉、上海）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 和岩馆老板攀谈，一窥业内行情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a> 面基小葛、小王 🤩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1847">30:47</a> 攀岩之外的国内与英国生活对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 开启干货分享环节！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a> 不二教练给大家介绍手臂和核心的训练方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2751">45:51</a> 如何训练手指力量？当然是要用上Beast Maker指力板啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">58:01</a> Last but not least, 耐力训练也得跟上哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】不二、小茶</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】小茶、不二</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dumb Love - Neil Frances</span></p><span></span><p><span>Espresso Sun - Citrus Avenue</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cool&amp;Chill - Mt1990</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tale of Time - Tobias Rauscher</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vessel - Trauzers, Star Party, Zookeepers</span></p><span></span><p><span>K.D. - Chang Ya Tung</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instantane - Paradis</span></p><span></span><p><span>Flat Dog - HYUKOH</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wave in dream - Mt1990</span></p><span></span><p><span>Whispers - Max Richter</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stay True (feat. Helena) - Men I Trust/Helena</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内岩馆：</span></p><span></span><p><span>成都 - 熊猫生活馆、飞蛙攀岩、黑爆攀岩</span></p><span></span><p><span>武汉 - 优胜美攀岩馆、新起点</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海 - 香蕉攀岩、攀岩主义、以及很多想探但还没来得及探的馆 🥲</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>攀岩书：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Beastmaking: A Fingers-first Approach to Becoming a Better Climber - Ned Feehally</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：噢不二呀｜Instragram：oubuer82</span></p>]]></description>
