    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大噶伙儿们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>💺💺💺💺💺💺💺</span></p><span></span><p><span>排排坐来磕糖🍬</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次播客我们邀请到了🌈 cp：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小葛@XX箐 &nbsp;和 小王@aka k4w 坐访。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期谈到了小葛和小王的相识经历，</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何从朋友变成恋人👭，</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于户外先锋的经历分享，</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有爱情取经秘籍！📖</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙和spotify都可直接🔍</span></p><span></span><p><span>【不二小茶会】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家和我们互动留言噢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐲祝大家</span></p><span></span><p><span>龙年行大运，</span></p><span></span><p><span>爬墙乐呵呵，</span></p><span></span><p><span>伤痛受伤远相离，</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱情事业双丰收，</span></p><span></span><p><span>健康快乐常相伴（＾∇＾）</span></p><span></span><p><span>新年快乐呀 🎆</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】不二、小茶</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】不二、小茶</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vanessa - Grimes</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cuco - melting</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wendy Marcini - feel you</span></p><span></span><p><span>张惠妹 - 火</span></p><span></span><p><span>9m88 - 看向我吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>方大同 - 特别的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>薛凯琪 - 找到天使了</span></p><span></span><p><span>9m88 - 看向我吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【线上攀岩coach】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chenchen在荒野（公众号搜索）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：噢不二呀｜Instragram：oubuer82</span></p>]]></description>
