  <item>
    <title>【不二小茶会 003】攀岩进步五部曲，爬墙开挂加速器</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6580af95157cd445ee8ae84d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6580af95157cd445ee8ae84d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Dec 2023 20:46:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们分享了各自的攀岩进步时间线，就如何在攀岩中取得进步和大家归纳总结分享了5点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>1多爬，多爬。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2多磕线，迎难而上，多和比自己厉害的人一起爬。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3尝试不同的路线，不要老是爬自己擅长的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>4做计划，有目标，思考beta路线。</span></p><span></span><p><span>5多观看攀岩比赛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 不二、小茶攀岩进步时间线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 想要进步，就得多爬；对，就是这么简单！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 上墙口号，上墙吧，攀岩人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 多磕线，爬不上去的线细细品、慢慢磕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> 尝试不同的路线，什么风格都试试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a> 制定计划，有针对的训练，释放J人能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a> 躺着进步？脑海里视觉化练习竟如此有用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1796">29:56</a> 攀岩比赛、书籍、视频分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 彩蛋？！这期只是一个小彩蛋，哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong><span>不二、小茶</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【剪辑】</span></strong><span>不二、小茶</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Vanessa - Grimes</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于等到你 - 张靓颖</span></p><span></span><p><span>Thomas&amp;Thomas - Minizza</span></p><span></span><p><span>A Sunny Day in a Cold Life - Minus</span></p><span></span><p><span>Passionfruit - Drake</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wake-Up call - sunshine blvd</span></p><span></span><p><span>Geppiojora - Hailmu</span></p><span></span><p><span>Under Pressure - Queen, David Bowie</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dancing with my phone - HYBS</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hollywood - The black Skirts</span></p><span></span><p><span>Coffee - beabadoobee</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>攀岩比赛</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>IFSC：International Federation of Sport Climbing</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>攀岩书</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Beastmaking: A Fingers-first Approach to Becoming a Better Climber - Ned Feehally</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Push: A Climber’s Journey of Endurance, Risk, and Going Beyond Limits - Tommy Caldwell</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>攀岩油管主</span></strong><span>:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hannah Morris Bouldering</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@hannahmorrisbouldering" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@hannahmorrisbouldering"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Jonathan Sin 冼洛正 climbing</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Jonathan_sin88" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@Jonathan_sin88"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Catalyst Climbing</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@CatalystClimbing" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@CatalystClimbing"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Movement for climbers</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@movementforclimbers" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@movementforclimbers"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：噢不二呀｜Instragram：oubuer82</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下一期我们会邀请嘉宾做客！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>还是一对拉子，预告大家来磕糖～</span></strong></p>]]></description>
