    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们分享了入门攀岩（抱石）的详细攻略（装备、价格、注意事项等，面面俱到），希望能帮助到初次接触攀岩的朋友们；也由小茶泪洒岩馆一事聊到了心态在攀岩中的重要性，祝大家都能快乐爬墙，冲啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 入门抱石装备介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 抱石需要结伴吗？E人I人 各有各的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 请教练还是靠自己？^_^</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 安全！安全！安全注意事项！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 室内攀岩所需经费，国内外价格比较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> 不是运动的“料”也能攀岩吗？当然可以！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 详细解读抱石规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 彩蛋环节又来了，听说小茶泪洒岩馆？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】不二、小茶</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】小茶、不二</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vanessa - Grimes</span></p><span></span><p><span>Feel You - Wendy Marcini</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stay Alive - Jose Gonzalez</span></p><span></span><p><span>烦恼歌 - 张学友</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内岩馆次卡交换小程序：Cika Exchange</span></p><span></span><p><span>攀岩App：Griptonite</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：噢不二呀｜Instragram：oubuer82</span></p>]]></description>
